            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne dekha ki do charges bina ek-doosre ko chhue door se force lagate hain. Par Michael Faraday ne ek gehra sawaal poocha: *\"Charge q₁ ko kaise pata chalta hai ki wahan q₂ baitha hai?\"* Unka jawab tha **Electric Field**: har charge apne charon taraf space mein ek adrishya (invisible) prabhav-kshetra bana deta hai, aur doosra charge usi field ko mehsoos karke bal khata hai! Is topic mein hum **Electric Field (E)**, **Electric Field Lines**, aur **Electric Dipole** (axial/equatorial field aur torque) seekhenge."
