            "bodyHinglish": "Chhuttiyon mein **Anil** apne school ke geography atlas mein Nainital ka **contour map** dekh raha tha. Usne dekha ki har gol contour line par ek height likhi thi — 1800 m, 1900 m, 2000 m. Agar koi aadmi ek hi 1900 m wali line par chalta rahe, to woh na upar jaata hai na neeche — gravity ke khilaaf **zero kaam**! Aur jahan contour lines bahut paas-paas thi, wahan pahad ki dhalan (slope) bahut tez thi!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne dekha to boli: \"Anil, electrostatics mein aisi hi surfaces ko **Equipotential Surfaces** kehte hain — jahan har point par potential V barabar hota hai, aur jahan yeh paas-paas hon wahan electric field **E** bahut tez hota hai!\""
