            "heading": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "body": "- **Equipotential Surface:** Aisi 3D surface jiske **har ek point par electrostatic potential V bilkul barabar** hota hai.\n- **Potential Gradient (ΔV / Δr):** Doori ke saath potential badalne ki dar (rate of change of potential with distance).\n- **Electrostatic Potential Energy (U):** Charges ke kisi system ko infinity se laakar unki present positions par rakhne mein kiya gaya total external work. SI unit **Joule (J)** (ya atomic scale par **electron-volt, eV**, jahan 1 eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ J).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Equipotential Surface:** Aisi 3D surface jiske **har ek point par electrostatic potential V bilkul barabar** hota hai.\n- **Potential Gradient (ΔV / Δr):** Doori ke saath potential badalne ki dar (rate of change of potential with distance).\n- **Electrostatic Potential Energy (U):** Charges ke kisi system ko infinity se laakar unki present positions par rakhne mein kiya gaya total external work. SI unit **Joule (J)** (ya atomic scale par **electron-volt, eV**, jahan 1 eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ J)."
