            "bodyHinglish": "Jab kisi conductor ke do sirhon par battery lagayi jaati hai, to andar ek electric field **E** ban jaata hai.\n- **Electric Current:** **I = Q / t**. Yaad rakho: current ki direction dikhate zaroor hain (+ se − ki taraf), par yeh **scalar** hai kyunki do taaron se aane wale currents vector addition nahi, seedha algebraic sum (3 A + 4 A = 7 A) follow karte hain!\n- **Current Density:** **J = I / A** (agar area A current ke perpendicular ho). Yeh **vector** quantity hai!"
