            "heading": "1-Metre Wire par Jockey ka Null Point",
            "headingHinglish": "1-Metre Wire par Jockey ka Null Point",
            "body": "School physics lab mein teacher ma'am ek lakdi ke lambe board par lage apparatus ko dikha rahi thin (low-voltage 2 V lab cell ke saath, bilkul safe demonstration). Us par ek 100 cm lambi patli manganin wire aur saath mein ek metre scale laga tha. **Ashok** ne dekha ki jaise hi ma'am ne brass **jockey** ko wire par dheere se touch kiya, galvanometer ki sui kabhi left to kabhi right ghoomi — aur theek **40 cm** par aakar sui **bilkul ZERO** par ruk gayi!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Ashok, jab sui exact zero par rukti hai (null deflection), to galvanometer se koi current nahi behta — aur tab hum **Meter Bridge** se unknown resistance aur **Potentiometer** se kisi cell ka asli **EMF** bina usse ek bhi electron khiche naap sakte hain!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School physics lab mein teacher ma'am ek lakdi ke lambe board par lage apparatus ko dikha rahi thin (low-voltage 2 V lab cell ke saath, bilkul safe demonstration). Us par ek 100 cm lambi patli manganin wire aur saath mein ek metre scale laga tha. **Ashok** ne dekha ki jaise hi ma'am ne brass **jockey** ko wire par dheere se touch kiya, galvanometer ki sui kabhi left to kabhi right ghoomi — aur theek **40 cm** par aakar sui **bilkul ZERO** par ruk gayi!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Ashok, jab sui exact zero par rukti hai (null deflection), to galvanometer se koi current nahi behta — aur tab hum **Meter Bridge** se unknown resistance aur **Potentiometer** se kisi cell ka asli **EMF** bina usse ek bhi electron khiche naap sakte hain!\""
