            "body": "**Bhoomi** library mein ek science magazine padh rahi thi, jismein North Pole ke aasman mein hare aur baingani rang ki chamakti hui roshni — **Aurora Borealis** — ki zabardast photo chhapi thi. Caption mein likha tha: \"Sooraj se aane wale tez charged particles Earth ke magnetic field se takrakar seedhe zameen par nahi girte, balki **spiral (helical) raaste** par ghoomte hue poles ki taraf mud jaate hain!\"\n\nBhoomi ne hairani se socha: \"Electric field to charge ko seedha dhakka deta hai, phir magnetic field charge ko gol-gol ya spiral kyun ghumata hai?\"\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Magnetism](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism.md) aur Class 10 mein [Electromagnetism](../../../class10/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md) mein chumbak aur Fleming's Left-Hand Rule ka basic parichay padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Magnetic Force** aur uske andar charged particles ke circular aur helical motion ka poora ganit seekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Bhoomi** library mein ek science magazine padh rahi thi, jismein North Pole ke aasman mein hare aur baingani rang ki chamakti hui roshni — **Aurora Borealis** — ki zabardast photo chhapi thi. Caption mein likha tha: \"Sooraj se aane wale tez charged particles Earth ke magnetic field se takrakar seedhe zameen par nahi girte, balki **spiral (helical) raaste** par ghoomte hue poles ki taraf mud jaate hain!\"\n\nBhoomi ne hairani se socha: \"Electric field to charge ko seedha dhakka deta hai, phir magnetic field charge ko gol-gol ya spiral kyun ghumata hai?\"\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Magnetism](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism.md) aur Class 10 mein [Electromagnetism](../../../class10/physics/electromagnetism/electromagnetism.md) mein chumbak aur Fleming's Left-Hand Rule ka basic parichay padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Magnetic Force** aur uske andar charged particles ke circular aur helical motion ka poora ganit seekhenge!"
