            "body": "Physics lab mein teacher ma'am ne ek vertical wooden frame par copper wire ke 50 chakkaron (turns) wali circular coil banayi aur use ek low-voltage 2 V battery se joda (safe teacher demonstration). **Dipti** ne dekha ki jaise hi switch on hua, coil ke bilkul centre par rakhe chhote magnetic compass ki sui turant ghoom kar coil ke axis ki taraf point karne lagi! Jab ma'am ne battery ka current double kiya, to deflection aur badh gaya!\n\nDipti ne poocha: \"Ma'am, hum kaise calculate karein ki kisi chhote se current-carrying wire ya poori circular coil se exact kitne Tesla ka magnetic field banta hai?\"\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Jaise electrostatics mein point charge ke liye Coulomb's law tha, waise hi magnetism mein chhote current element ke liye hota hai — **Biot-Savart Law**!\"",
