            "bodyHinglish": "Science museum ke medical-physics gallery mein **Feroz** ne ek MRI machine ka cut-open model dekha. Uske andar ek lambi khokhli cylinder par copper wire ke hazaaron tight chakkar (turns) lipte hue the — aur bagal mein ek doughnut (vada) ke aakar ki gol ring par bhi wire lipti thi!\n\nGuide ne bataya: \"Lambi cylinder wali coil ko **Solenoid** kehte hain, aur doughnut wali ring ko **Toroid**. Inke andar bilkul uniform aur strong magnetic field banta hai — aur inka formula Biot-Savart se nahi, balki magnetism ke sabse bade shortcut **Ampere's Circuital Law** se sirf 3 line mein nikalta hai!\""
