            "heading": "1. Ampere's Circuital Law (Magnetism ka Gauss's Law!)",
            "headingHinglish": "1. Ampere's Circuital Law (Magnetism ka Gauss's Law!)",
            "body": "Electrostatics mein closed **surface** par Gauss's law (Φ = q_enc / ε₀) tha. Magnetism mein closed **loop (boundary)** par **Ampere's Circuital Law** hota hai:\n\n**Σ B_∥ Δl = μ₀ I_enc**\n\n*(Jahan B_∥ loop ki tangent ke along magnetic field hai, Δl loop ka chhota tukda hai, aur I_enc loop ke andar se guzarne wala net current hai.)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Electrostatics mein closed **surface** par Gauss's law (Φ = q_enc / ε₀) tha. Magnetism mein closed **loop (boundary)** par **Ampere's Circuital Law** hota hai:\n\n**Σ B_∥ Δl = μ₀ I_enc**\n\n*(Jahan B_∥ loop ki tangent ke along magnetic field hai, Δl loop ka chhota tukda hai, aur I_enc loop ke andar se guzarne wala net current hai.)*"
