            "body": "Table saaf karte waqt **Heera** ke haath se ek chhota bar magnet farsh par gir kar theek beech se **do tukdon** mein toot gaya. Heera ne socha: \"Oh no! Ab ek tukde mein sirf North pole bacha hoga aur doosre mein sirf South pole!\" Par jab usne dono tukdon ko paas laaya, to hairaan reh gaya — **dono tukdon ke apne-apne North aur South poles the!**\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Heera, electric charges (+ aur −) ko tum alag kar sakte ho, par **magnetic poles hamesha jode (dipole) mein hi milte hain!** Akele North ya akele South pole (**magnetic monopole**) ka duniya mein koi wajood nahi — aur yahi hai **Gauss's Law for Magnetism**!\"\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Magnetism](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism.md) mein bar magnet ke basic gun padhe the. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Bar Magnet as a Magnetic Dipole**, uske axial/equatorial fields, aur **Gauss's Law for Magnetism** ka poora mathematical roop seekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Table saaf karte waqt **Heera** ke haath se ek chhota bar magnet farsh par gir kar theek beech se **do tukdon** mein toot gaya. Heera ne socha: \"Oh no! Ab ek tukde mein sirf North pole bacha hoga aur doosre mein sirf South pole!\" Par jab usne dono tukdon ko paas laaya, to hairaan reh gaya — **dono tukdon ke apne-apne North aur South poles the!**\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Heera, electric charges (+ aur −) ko tum alag kar sakte ho, par **magnetic poles hamesha jode (dipole) mein hi milte hain!** Akele North ya akele South pole (**magnetic monopole**) ka duniya mein koi wajood nahi — aur yahi hai **Gauss's Law for Magnetism**!\"\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Magnetism](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism.md) mein bar magnet ke basic gun padhe the. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Bar Magnet as a Magnetic Dipole**, uske axial/equatorial fields, aur **Gauss's Law for Magnetism** ka poora mathematical roop seekhenge!"
