            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "body": "- **Magnetic Dipole Moment (m→):** Bar magnet ki magnetic taqat: **m = q_m × (2l)** (jahan q_m pole strength aur 2l magnetic length hai). Direction: magnet ke andar **South se North pole** ki taraf! SI unit **A m²** (or J/T).\n- **Magnetic Monopole:** Ek akela North ya akela South pole — jo nature mein **exist nahi karta**!\n- **Gauss's Law for Magnetism:** Kisi bhi closed surface se guzarne wala total magnetic flux hamesha **ZERO** hota hai: **Φ_B = Σ (B · ΔA) = 0**.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Magnetic Dipole Moment (m→):** Bar magnet ki magnetic taqat: **m = q_m × (2l)** (jahan q_m pole strength aur 2l magnetic length hai). Direction: magnet ke andar **South se North pole** ki taraf! SI unit **A m²** (or J/T).\n- **Magnetic Monopole:** Ek akela North ya akela South pole — jo nature mein **exist nahi karta**!\n- **Gauss's Law for Magnetism:** Kisi bhi closed surface se guzarne wala total magnetic flux hamesha **ZERO** hota hai: **Φ_B = Σ (B · ΔA) = 0**."
