            "heading": "3. Tangent Law & Deflection Magnetometer",
            "headingHinglish": "3. Tangent Law & Deflection Magnetometer",
            "body": "Jab do perpendicular uniform horizontal magnetic fields **B** aur **B_H** lagte hain, to compass needle **B_H** se angle **θ** par equilibrium mein rukti hai:\n\n```\n   B = B_H tan θ    (Tangent Law!)\n```\n\n- **Tan-A (End-on / Axial) Position:** B_axial = (μ₀/4π)(2m/r³) = B_H tan θ.\n- **Tan-B (Broadside-on / Equatorial) Position:** B_eq = (μ₀/4π)(m/r³) = B_H tan θ.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Jab do perpendicular uniform horizontal magnetic fields **B** aur **B_H** lagte hain, to compass needle **B_H** se angle **θ** par equilibrium mein rukti hai:\n\n```\n   B = B_H tan θ    (Tangent Law!)\n```\n\n- **Tan-A (End-on / Axial) Position:** B_axial = (μ₀/4π)(2m/r³) = B_H tan θ.\n- **Tan-B (Broadside-on / Equatorial) Position:** B_eq = (μ₀/4π)(m/r³) = B_H tan θ."
