            "bodyHinglish": "Electric dipoles ki tarah, do short coaxial bar magnets (moments **m₁, m₂**, centre-to-centre distance **r >> l**) ke beech force **1 / r⁴** ke hisaab se ghatta hai:\n\n```\n   F = (μ₀ / 4π) × (6 m₁ m₂) / r⁴\n```"
