            "body": "Physics lab mein teacher ma'am ne ek strong horseshoe magnet ke dono poles ke beech ek solid copper ki plate ko pendulum ki tarah latka diya (safe classroom demo). **Leena** ne dekha ki jab ma'am ne plate ko chhoda, to woh hawa mein hi bina magnet ko chhooye achanak **dheemi hokar turant ruk gayi**! Phir ma'am ne waisi hi doosri copper plate lagayi jismein kanghi (comb) jaise **patle slots (cuts)** kate the — aur woh plate aaram se kaafi der tak jhoolti rahi!\n\nLeena ne poocha: \"Ma'am, copper to chumbak se chipakta bhi nahi hai, phir solid copper plate bina chhooye brake kaise lag gayi — aur slots kaatne par brake gayab kyun ho gayi?\"\n\nTeacher ma'am boli: \"Solid metal plate ke andar badalte magnetic flux se paani ke bhanwar (whirlpools) jaise gol-gol induced currents ban jaate hain — inhein **Eddy Currents** kehte hain!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Physics lab mein teacher ma'am ne ek strong horseshoe magnet ke dono poles ke beech ek solid copper ki plate ko pendulum ki tarah latka diya (safe classroom demo). **Leena** ne dekha ki jab ma'am ne plate ko chhoda, to woh hawa mein hi bina magnet ko chhooye achanak **dheemi hokar turant ruk gayi**! Phir ma'am ne waisi hi doosri copper plate lagayi jismein kanghi (comb) jaise **patle slots (cuts)** kate the — aur woh plate aaram se kaafi der tak jhoolti rahi!\n\nLeena ne poocha: \"Ma'am, copper to chumbak se chipakta bhi nahi hai, phir solid copper plate bina chhooye brake kaise lag gayi — aur slots kaatne par brake gayab kyun ho gayi?\"\n\nTeacher ma'am boli: \"Solid metal plate ke andar badalte magnetic flux se paani ke bhanwar (whirlpools) jaise gol-gol induced currents ban jaate hain — inhein **Eddy Currents** kehte hain!\""
