            "body": "| Aspect | Key Detail |\n|---|---|\n| What are Eddy Currents? | Swirling induced currents inside bulk conductors in changing magnetic flux |\n| Undesirable Effect | Unwanted Joule heating (I²R) in transformer & motor cores |\n| How to Minimise | Use **slotted plates** or **laminated insulated cores** |\n| 4 Major Applications | Magnetic brakes in trains, EM damping in galvanometers, Induction furnace, Electric power meters |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Aspect | Key Detail |\n|---|---|\n| What are Eddy Currents? | Swirling induced currents inside bulk conductors in changing magnetic flux |\n| Undesirable Effect | Unwanted Joule heating (I²R) in transformer & motor cores |\n| How to Minimise | Use **slotted plates** or **laminated insulated cores** |\n| 4 Major Applications | Magnetic brakes in trains, EM damping in galvanometers, Induction furnace, Electric power meters |"
