            "body": "**Mukesh** apne dada ji ke puraane FM radio ki tuning knob ghuma raha tha. Poore dial par halka sa shor (static) tha, par jaise hi pointer **98.3 MHz** par pahuncha, achanak saaf aur tez gaana baj utha! Thoda sa bhi aage ya peeche ghumane par aawaz phir gayab ho jaati thi!\n\nDada ji muskuraye: \"Radio ke andar ek **Series LCR Circuit** laga hai! Jab knob ghumakar tum us circuit ki natural frequency ko 98.3 MHz se **match** kar dete ho, to us khaas frequency ke liye current achanak **maximum** ho jaata hai — aur baaki sab stations dab jaate hain! Isse **Electrical Resonance** kehte hain!\"",
