            "body": "School se ghar aate waqt **Neeraj** ne door footpath se apni colony ke corner par khambhon ke upar lage bade grey metal box ko dekha (hamesha safe doori par — high voltage khatarnak hota hai!). Papa ne bataya: \"Power station se bijli hazaaron volts (11 kV ya 132 kV) par aati hai taaki taaron mein heat loss kam ho. Phir yeh **Transformer** bina koi part hilaye us 11,000 V AC ko gharon ke liye 220 V AC mein badal deta hai!\"\n\nAaj hum **LC Oscillations** (energy ka electric ↔ magnetic jhoola) aur **Transformer** ka poora working principle, formulas aur energy losses seekhenge!",
