            "headingHinglish": "Radio Tower se X-Ray Machine tak — Ek hi Parivaar!",
            "body": "Science-tech expo ke ek lambe corridor mein **Nutun** ne 7 alag-alag stalls dekhe: Radio transmitter, Radar & Microwave oven, TV remote (Infrared), Rainbow prism (Visible light), Water purifier UV lamp, Hospital X-ray film, aur Gamma-ray telescope! Nutun ne guide se poocha: \"Yeh saaton itni alag-alag cheezein ek hi gallery mein kyun rakhi hain?\"\n\nGuide muskuraye: \"Kyunki yeh saaton asal mein **ek hi Electromagnetic Wave family** ke sadasya hain! Vacuum mein in sabki speed bilkul same (**c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s**) hai — bas inki **wavelength (λ)** aur **frequency (f)** alag-alag hai!\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Scattering and Spectrum](../../../class10/physics/scattering-and-spectrum/scattering-and-spectrum.md) mein visible spectrum (VIBGYOR) dekha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum poora **Electromagnetic Spectrum** — Radio se Gamma rays tak — detail mein dekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Science-tech expo ke ek lambe corridor mein **Nutun** ne 7 alag-alag stalls dekhe: Radio transmitter, Radar & Microwave oven, TV remote (Infrared), Rainbow prism (Visible light), Water purifier UV lamp, Hospital X-ray film, aur Gamma-ray telescope! Nutun ne guide se poocha: \"Yeh saaton itni alag-alag cheezein ek hi gallery mein kyun rakhi hain?\"\n\nGuide muskuraye: \"Kyunki yeh saaton asal mein **ek hi Electromagnetic Wave family** ke sadasya hain! Vacuum mein in sabki speed bilkul same (**c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s**) hai — bas inki **wavelength (λ)** aur **frequency (f)** alag-alag hai!\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Scattering and Spectrum](../../../class10/physics/scattering-and-spectrum/scattering-and-spectrum.md) mein visible spectrum (VIBGYOR) dekha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum poora **Electromagnetic Spectrum** — Radio se Gamma rays tak — detail mein dekhenge!"
