            "body": "1. **Wavelength aur Frequency ka order ulta kar dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Gamma rays ki wavelength sabse badi hoti hai bolna!\n   - *Sahi:* **Radio waves = Longest λ, Lowest f**; **Gamma rays = Shortest λ, Highest f**!\n2. **Sochna ki Gamma rays vacuum mein Radio waves se tez chalti hain:**\n   - *Galat:* Gamma rays ki energy zyada hai isliye unki speed c se zyada hogi.\n   - *Sahi:* Vacuum mein **SAARI** EM waves exact **c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s** ki speed se chalti hain!\n3. **Infrared aur Ultraviolet ke kaam mix kar dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Greenhouse effect UV se hota hai ya water purifier mein IR use hota hai bolna.\n   - *Sahi:* **Infrared = Heat waves (Greenhouse effect, TV remote)**; **Ultraviolet = Germ killing (water purifier) & blocked by Ozone layer**!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Wavelength aur Frequency ka order ulta kar dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Gamma rays ki wavelength sabse badi hoti hai bolna!\n   - *Sahi:* **Radio waves = Longest λ, Lowest f**; **Gamma rays = Shortest λ, Highest f**!\n2. **Sochna ki Gamma rays vacuum mein Radio waves se tez chalti hain:**\n   - *Galat:* Gamma rays ki energy zyada hai isliye unki speed c se zyada hogi.\n   - *Sahi:* Vacuum mein **SAARI** EM waves exact **c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s** ki speed se chalti hain!\n3. **Infrared aur Ultraviolet ke kaam mix kar dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Greenhouse effect UV se hota hai ya water purifier mein IR use hota hai bolna.\n   - *Sahi:* **Infrared = Heat waves (Greenhouse effect, TV remote)**; **Ultraviolet = Germ killing (water purifier) & blocked by Ozone layer**!"
