            "headingHinglish": "Dentist ka Mirror aur Car ka Rear-View Mirror!",
            "body": "Dental clinic mein **Payal** ne dekha ki dentist ek chhote se **concave mirror** ko daant ke bahut paas le jaakar dekhta hai to daant ka bada aur seedha (magnified erect) image dikhta hai! Clinic se bahar aakar jab woh Papa ki car mein baithi, to side wale **convex mirror** par likha tha: *\"Objects in mirror are closer than they appear\"* — kyunki usmein peeche ki poori sadak ki chhoti aur seedhi image dikh rahi thi!\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Light Reflection](../../../class9/physics/light-reflection/light-reflection.md) mein spherical mirrors aur ray diagrams ka basic parichay padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Cartesian Sign Convention**, **f = R / 2** ka geometry proof, aur **Mirror Equation** ke exact numericals master karenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Dental clinic mein **Payal** ne dekha ki dentist ek chhote se **concave mirror** ko daant ke bahut paas le jaakar dekhta hai to daant ka bada aur seedha (magnified erect) image dikhta hai! Clinic se bahar aakar jab woh Papa ki car mein baithi, to side wale **convex mirror** par likha tha: *\"Objects in mirror are closer than they appear\"* — kyunki usmein peeche ki poori sadak ki chhoti aur seedhi image dikh rahi thi!\n\nClass 9 mein tumne [Light Reflection](../../../class9/physics/light-reflection/light-reflection.md) mein spherical mirrors aur ray diagrams ka basic parichay padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Cartesian Sign Convention**, **f = R / 2** ka geometry proof, aur **Mirror Equation** ke exact numericals master karenge!"
