            "headingHinglish": "Optician ki Dukaan aur Chashme ke Lens ka Formula!",
            "body": "**Pragya** apni Mummy ka naya chashma (+2.0 D power ka) banwane optician ki dukaan par gayi thi. Wahan usne dekha ki optician ke paas alag-alag curve (radius of curvature R₁ aur R₂) wale glass blanks rakhe the. Pragya ne poocha: \"Uncle, aapko kaise pata chalta hai ki +2.0 D power ke liye glass ke dono faces ko kitna gol (curved) ghisna hai?\"\n\nOptician muskuraye: \"Iske liye physics ka ek zabardast formula hai — **Lens Maker's Formula**! Glass ka refractive index n aur dono surfaces ke radii R₁, R₂ daalo, aur exact focal length **f** aur power **P** mil jaati hai!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Pragya** apni Mummy ka naya chashma (+2.0 D power ka) banwane optician ki dukaan par gayi thi. Wahan usne dekha ki optician ke paas alag-alag curve (radius of curvature R₁ aur R₂) wale glass blanks rakhe the. Pragya ne poocha: \"Uncle, aapko kaise pata chalta hai ki +2.0 D power ke liye glass ke dono faces ko kitna gol (curved) ghisna hai?\"\n\nOptician muskuraye: \"Iske liye physics ka ek zabardast formula hai — **Lens Maker's Formula**! Glass ka refractive index n aur dono surfaces ke radii R₁, R₂ daalo, aur exact focal length **f** aur power **P** mil jaati hai!\""
