            "headingHinglish": "Pyaaz ki Cells aur Shani (Saturn) ke Chhalle!",
            "body": "Biology lab mein **Pramod** ne ek **Compound Microscope** mein pyaaz ki patli jhilli (onion peel) dekhi to nanhi-nanhi cells badi aur saaf dikhi! Aur usi shaam school ke astronomy club mein usne chhat par lage **Astronomical Telescope** se Shani grah (Saturn) ke khoobsurat chhalle dekhe!\n\nPramod ne teacher ma'am se poocha: \"Dono instruments mein do-do convex lenses lage hain — phir microscope paas ki chhoti cheez bada dikhata hai aur telescope lakhon km door ke taare paas kaise laata hai?\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [The Human Eye](../../../class10/physics/human-eye/human-eye.md) (near point **D = 25 cm**, far point ∞, myopia/hypermetropia) padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Simple Microscope**, **Compound Microscope**, aur **Refracting & Reflecting Telescopes** ke exact magnifying power formulas seekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Biology lab mein **Pramod** ne ek **Compound Microscope** mein pyaaz ki patli jhilli (onion peel) dekhi to nanhi-nanhi cells badi aur saaf dikhi! Aur usi shaam school ke astronomy club mein usne chhat par lage **Astronomical Telescope** se Shani grah (Saturn) ke khoobsurat chhalle dekhe!\n\nPramod ne teacher ma'am se poocha: \"Dono instruments mein do-do convex lenses lage hain — phir microscope paas ki chhoti cheez bada dikhata hai aur telescope lakhon km door ke taare paas kaise laata hai?\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [The Human Eye](../../../class10/physics/human-eye/human-eye.md) (near point **D = 25 cm**, far point ∞, myopia/hypermetropia) padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Simple Microscope**, **Compound Microscope**, aur **Refracting & Reflecting Telescopes** ke exact magnifying power formulas seekhenge!"
