            "body": "School science club ke \"Optics Observatory Challenge\" mein **Prashant** ko chaar mixed-concept problems solve karne the:\n1. Ek convex glass lens ko aise liquid mein duboya jiska refractive index glass se zyada hai — kya woh diverging ban jayega?\n2. Ek convex lens ke peeche plane mirror rakh kar image ko object par hi wapas laana;\n3. Do lenses (ek + aur ek −) ko mila kar microscope/telescope design karna;\n4. Prism mein minimum deviation aur TIR critical angle ko ek saath check karna!\n\nChalo Prashant ke saath poora Ray Optics chapter mila kar solve karte hain!",
