            "bodyHinglish": "| Sawaal mein kya dikhe? | Kaunsa tool chuno? | Key Formula |\n|---|---|---|\n| Concave / Convex mirror | Mirror formula (PLUS!) | 1/v + 1/u = 1/f; m = −v/u; f = R/2 |\n| Pool depth / coin raised / optical fibre / diamond | Apparent depth & TIR | d_app = d_real/n; sin i_c = 1/n (Denser → Rarer!) |\n| Grinding lens / dipping lens in liquid | Lens Maker's Formula | 1/f = (n_lens/n_med − 1)(1/R₁ − 1/R₂) |\n| Thin lens & contact lenses | Lens formula (MINUS!) & Power | 1/v − 1/u = 1/f; m = +v/u; P = 100/f(cm); P = P₁ + P₂ |\n| Triangular prism minimum deviation | Exact Prism Formula | n = sin[(A + D_m)/2] / sin(A/2); Thin: δ = (n−1)A |\n| Microscope / Telescope | Optical Instruments | Micro: (L/f_o)(D/f_e); Tele: M = f_o/f_e, L = f_o + f_e |"
