            "bodyHinglish": "Park ke shant talaab mein **Praveen** ne ek chhota sa kankar daala. Turant paani ki satah par ek ke baad ek **gol-gol lehrein (concentric ripples)** bahar ki taraf failti gayin — aur har gol ring par paani ke sabhi particles ek hi samay par upar uth rahe the (same phase mein)!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne bataya: \"1678 mein Christiaan Huygens ne kaha tha ki light bhi bilkul aisi hi **tarangon (waves)** ke roop mein chalti hai! Ek hi phase mein vibrate karne wale sabhi points ko milane wali satah ko **Wavefront** kehte hain — aur isse reflection aur refraction ke dono niyam bina kisi ray assumption ke seedha prove ho jaate hain!\""
