            "body": "Jheel ke kinare dhoop mein ghoomte waqt **Puja** ki aankhon mein paani se reflect hoti tez chamak (glare) chubh rahi thi. Papa ne use apne **Polarised Sunglasses** pehnaye — aur jaadu ho gaya! Paani ki chubhti chamak turant gayab ho gayi, aur paani ke andar ki machhliyan tak saaf dikhne lagin! Jab Puja ne apna sir 90° tirchha kiya, to chamak wapas aa gayi!\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Sooraj ki aam roshni mein electric field har direction mein vibrate karta hai (**unpolarised**), par paani se reflect hokar woh sirf **horizontal plane** mein vibrate karne lagta hai (**polarised**)! Is chashme ka Polaroid filter sirf vertical vibrations ko aane deta hai — aur yahi **Polarisation** sabit karta hai ki light ek **Transverse Wave** hai!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Jheel ke kinare dhoop mein ghoomte waqt **Puja** ki aankhon mein paani se reflect hoti tez chamak (glare) chubh rahi thi. Papa ne use apne **Polarised Sunglasses** pehnaye — aur jaadu ho gaya! Paani ki chubhti chamak turant gayab ho gayi, aur paani ke andar ki machhliyan tak saaf dikhne lagin! Jab Puja ne apna sir 90° tirchha kiya, to chamak wapas aa gayi!\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Sooraj ki aam roshni mein electric field har direction mein vibrate karta hai (**unpolarised**), par paani se reflect hokar woh sirf **horizontal plane** mein vibrate karne lagta hai (**polarised**)! Is chashme ka Polaroid filter sirf vertical vibrations ko aane deta hai — aur yahi **Polarisation** sabit karta hai ki light ek **Transverse Wave** hai!\""
