            "heading": "1. YDSE with a Thin Transparent Slab in Front of One Slit",
            "headingHinglish": "1. YDSE with a Thin Transparent Slab in Front of One Slit",
            "body": "Agar Slit S₁ ke raaste mein thickness **t** aur refractive index **n** ki patli sheet rakh di jaaye:\n- Extra optical path introduced = **Δx_extra = (n − 1) t**!\n- Central maximum wahan shift hota hai jahan net path difference zero ho (S₁ ki taraf!):\n\n```\n   Fringe Shift:  Δy = [ (n − 1) t D ] / d = (n − 1) t × (β / λ)\n   Number of fringes shifted:  N = Δy / β = (n − 1) t / λ\n```\n\n*(Note: Fringe width **β = λ D / d BILKUL NAHI badalti** — poora pattern bas shift ho jaata hai!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Agar Slit S₁ ke raaste mein thickness **t** aur refractive index **n** ki patli sheet rakh di jaaye:\n- Extra optical path introduced = **Δx_extra = (n − 1) t**!\n- Central maximum wahan shift hota hai jahan net path difference zero ho (S₁ ki taraf!):\n\n```\n   Fringe Shift:  Δy = [ (n − 1) t D ] / d = (n − 1) t × (β / λ)\n   Number of fringes shifted:  N = Δy / β = (n − 1) t / λ\n```\n\n*(Note: Fringe width **β = λ D / d BILKUL NAHI badalti** — poora pattern bas shift ho jaata hai!)*"
