            "bodyHinglish": "Woh doori jahan tak single-slit diffraction ka phailav (λ Z_F / a) slit ki apni width **a** ke barabar na ho jaaye (yaani jahan tak Ray Optics sahi chalta hai!):\n\n```\n   Z_F = a² / λ\n```"
