            "bodyHinglish": "Shaam ko andhera hote hi **Rajni** ne dekha ki uske mohalle ki automatic solar street lights bina kisi ke switch dabaye apne aap jal uthin — aur subah dhoop nikalte hi bandh ho gayin! Papa ne bataya ki inke andar ek chhota **photocell** laga hota hai jismein light padne par metal plate se electrons bahar nikalte hain aur current banate hain!\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Radioactivity](../../../class10/physics/radioactivity/radioactivity.md) mein atomic radiations aur electron-volt ka basic parichay padha tha. Aaj Class 12 mein hum seekhenge **Photoelectric Effect** — woh historic experiment jisne wave theory ko hila diya aur **Quantum Physics** ki shuruat ki!"
