            "body": "| Sawaal mein kya dikhe? | Kaunsa tool chuno? | Key Formula |\n|---|---|---|\n| Photon energy from λ (nm) | Fast eV shortcut! | E(eV) = 1240 / λ(nm); E(J) = hν = hc/λ |\n| Photoelectric K_max, V₀, φ₀ | Einstein's Equation (same units!) | K_max = e V₀ = hν − φ₀ = hc(1/λ − 1/λ₀) |\n| Max speed of photoelectron | Convert K_max to Joules first! | v_max = √(2 K_max / m_e) |\n| Photons per second from power P | Photon flux | N / t = P / (hν) = P λ / (h c) |\n| de Broglie wavelength of electron at voltage V | Electron shortcut | λ_e = 1.227 / √V nm = 12.27 / √V Å |\n| de Broglie ratio of any two particles | General formula | λ = h / √(2mK) = h / √(2mqV) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Sawaal mein kya dikhe? | Kaunsa tool chuno? | Key Formula |\n|---|---|---|\n| Photon energy from λ (nm) | Fast eV shortcut! | E(eV) = 1240 / λ(nm); E(J) = hν = hc/λ |\n| Photoelectric K_max, V₀, φ₀ | Einstein's Equation (same units!) | K_max = e V₀ = hν − φ₀ = hc(1/λ − 1/λ₀) |\n| Max speed of photoelectron | Convert K_max to Joules first! | v_max = √(2 K_max / m_e) |\n| Photons per second from power P | Photon flux | N / t = P / (hν) = P λ / (h c) |\n| de Broglie wavelength of electron at voltage V | Electron shortcut | λ_e = 1.227 / √V nm = 12.27 / √V Å |\n| de Broglie ratio of any two particles | General formula | λ = h / √(2mK) = h / √(2mqV) |"
