            "body": "- **Alpha Particle (α):** Helium nucleus (⁴₂He) — charge **+2e** aur mass lagbhag **4 proton masses**!\n- **Impact Parameter (b):** Alpha particle ki initial velocity line aur nucleus ke centre ke beech ki **perpendicular doori**. (Head-on collision mein **b = 0 ⟹ θ = 180°**!)\n- **Distance of Closest Approach (r₀):** Head-on collision (b = 0) mein alpha particle nucleus ke jitna **sabse paas** pahunch kar pal bhar ke liye rukta hai (aur phir wapas laut'ta hai) — yeh nucleus ke size ki **upper limit** deta hai!",
