            "body": "1. **Atomic Instability (Spiral Collapse):** Classical electromagnetism kehti hai ki circle mein ghoomta hua electron **accelerated** hai — isliye use lagataar **EM waves radiate** karni chahiye! Energy ghat'te-ghat'te electron ko sirf **10⁻⁸ second** mein spiral hokar nucleus mein gir jaana chahiye tha! Par asal mein atoms bilkul **stable** hote hain!\n2. **Continuous vs Line Spectrum:** Spiral girte waqt electron ki frequency lagataar badalni chahiye thi ⟹ **continuous rainbow spectrum** milna chahiye tha! Par real gases (jaise Hydrogen) sirf **sharp discrete line spectrum** deti hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Atomic Instability (Spiral Collapse):** Classical electromagnetism kehti hai ki circle mein ghoomta hua electron **accelerated** hai — isliye use lagataar **EM waves radiate** karni chahiye! Energy ghat'te-ghat'te electron ko sirf **10⁻⁸ second** mein spiral hokar nucleus mein gir jaana chahiye tha! Par asal mein atoms bilkul **stable** hote hain!\n2. **Continuous vs Line Spectrum:** Spiral girte waqt electron ki frequency lagataar badalni chahiye thi ⟹ **continuous rainbow spectrum** milna chahiye tha! Par real gases (jaise Hydrogen) sirf **sharp discrete line spectrum** deti hain!"
