            "headingHinglish": "Aam Galtiyan (Common Mistakes)",
            "body": "1. **Alpha particle ka charge +e rakh dena (+2e bhool jaana!):**\n   - *Galat:* r₀ = k Z e² / K likhna!\n   - *Sahi:* Alpha particle (⁴₂He) mein **2 protons (+2e)** hote hain ⟹ **r₀ = (2 k Z e²) / K**!\n2. **MeV ko Joules mein convert karna bhool jaana:**\n   - *Galat:* K = 5 MeV ko seedha 5 ya 5 × 10⁶ rakh dena!\n   - *Sahi:* **1 eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ J** ⟹ **1 MeV = 10⁶ eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹³ J**!\n3. **Impact parameter b = 0 par θ = 0° bol dena:**\n   - *Galat:* b = 0 matlab koi scattering nahi!\n   - *Sahi:* b = 0 ka matlab **seedhi head-on takkar** ⟹ **θ = 180°** (maximum deflection, seedha wapas)!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Alpha particle ka charge +e rakh dena (+2e bhool jaana!):**\n   - *Galat:* r₀ = k Z e² / K likhna!\n   - *Sahi:* Alpha particle (⁴₂He) mein **2 protons (+2e)** hote hain ⟹ **r₀ = (2 k Z e²) / K**!\n2. **MeV ko Joules mein convert karna bhool jaana:**\n   - *Galat:* K = 5 MeV ko seedha 5 ya 5 × 10⁶ rakh dena!\n   - *Sahi:* **1 eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ J** ⟹ **1 MeV = 10⁶ eV = 1.6 × 10⁻¹³ J**!\n3. **Impact parameter b = 0 par θ = 0° bol dena:**\n   - *Galat:* b = 0 matlab koi scattering nahi!\n   - *Sahi:* b = 0 ka matlab **seedhi head-on takkar** ⟹ **θ = 180°** (maximum deflection, seedha wapas)!"
