            "body": "| Concept | Formula / Value | Key Fact |\n|---|---|---|\n| Atomic vs Nuclear Size | Atom: ~10⁻¹⁰ m; Nucleus: ~10⁻¹⁵ m | Atom is mostly empty space! |\n| Impact Parameter (b) | b = 0 ⟹ θ = 180°; large b ⟹ θ ≈ 0° | Perpendicular distance of velocity line from nucleus |\n| Distance of Closest Approach | **r₀ = (2 k Z e²) / K** (for α-particle) | Upper limit on nuclear radius; r₀ ∝ 1/K |\n| Rutherford's 2 Failures | (1) Predicts spiral collapse; (2) Predicts continuous spectrum | Fixed by **Bohr's Quantum Model**! |",
