            "bodyHinglish": "Shaam ko bazaar mein **Roma** ne notice kiya ki aam safed tungsten bulb ki roshni prism se guzarne par poora **continuous rainbow** banati hai, par sadak par lage peele **sodium vapour lamp** ki roshni mein sirf kuch **khaas chamakdaar peeli lines** hi hoti hain (baaki rang bilkul gayab)!\n\nTeacher ma'am boli: \"Har element (Hydrogen, Sodium, Neon) ka apna ek unique **Line Spectrum** — atom ka fingerprint — hota hai! 1913 mein **Niels Bohr** ne teen bold quantum postulates dekar Hydrogen atom ki stability aur uske line spectrum dono ko exact numbers ke saath samjha diya!\""
