            "bodyHinglish": "- **Line Emission Spectrum:** Garam gas ke atoms dwara sirf kuch **khaas discrete wavelengths (bright lines on dark background)** ki light chhodna.\n- **Stationary Orbits:** Bohr ke anusaar woh khaas allowed circular orbits jinmein ghoomte hue electron **koi EM radiation nahi chhodta** (energy constant rehti hai!).\n- **Bohr Radius (a₀):** Hydrogen atom ki sabse chhoti (n = 1) orbit ka radius: **a₀ = 0.529 Å ≈ 0.53 Å = 0.053 nm**."
