            "heading": "Gol Rubber Band par Standing Waves aur Bohr ka Raaz!",
            "headingHinglish": "Gol Rubber Band par Standing Waves aur Bohr ka Raaz!",
            "body": "**Rubina** ek gol rubber ring ko vibrate kara rahi thi — usne dekha ki stable (standing) wave tabhi banti hai jab poori circumference (**2π r**) par waves ki **poori ginti (1λ, 2λ, 3λ... = nλ)** exact fit ho jaaye! Agar 2.5λ ho to wave apne aap se takrakar khatam ho jaati hai!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"1924 mein **de Broglie** ne bilkul yahi sochkar Bohr ke sabse bade rahasya (**L = n h / 2π kyun?**) ko 2 line mein prove kar diya tha! Saath hi aaj hum Hydrogen ke **5 Spectral Series** (Lyman, Balmer, Paschen, Brackett, Pfund) bhi seekhenge!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Rubina** ek gol rubber ring ko vibrate kara rahi thi — usne dekha ki stable (standing) wave tabhi banti hai jab poori circumference (**2π r**) par waves ki **poori ginti (1λ, 2λ, 3λ... = nλ)** exact fit ho jaaye! Agar 2.5λ ho to wave apne aap se takrakar khatam ho jaati hai!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"1924 mein **de Broglie** ne bilkul yahi sochkar Bohr ke sabse bade rahasya (**L = n h / 2π kyun?**) ko 2 line mein prove kar diya tha! Saath hi aaj hum Hydrogen ke **5 Spectral Series** (Lyman, Balmer, Paschen, Brackett, Pfund) bhi seekhenge!\""
