            "bodyHinglish": "Jab ek tez **Hydrogen atom** (mass m, speed v, KE = K) ek **stationary Hydrogen atom** (mass m) se head-on takrata hai, to momentum conservation ke karan max **50% (K / 2)** energy hi internal excitation mein ja sakti hai!\n- 1st excitation (n = 1 → n = 2) ke liye **10.2 eV** chahiye ⟹ incident Hydrogen atom ki minimum KE honi chahiye: **K_min = 2 × 10.2 = 20.4 eV**!"
