            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Bhaari nucleus (Uranium) ki density halke nucleus (Carbon) se zyada bol dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Uranium mein 238 nucleons hain isliye uski nuclear density Carbon se 20 guna zyada hai!\n   - *Sahi:* Volume bhi A ke saath badhta hai ⟹ A kat jaata hai ⟹ **Nuclear density sabhi nuclei ke liye CONSTANT (1 : 1)** hoti hai!\n2. **R ∝ A likh dena (cube root bhool jaana!):**\n   - *Galat:* A = 64 ka radius A = 8 ke radius se 8 guna bada hoga!\n   - *Sahi:* **R ∝ A^(1/3)** ⟹ (64/8)^(1/3) = 8^(1/3) = **2 guna**!\n3. **Isotopes, Isobars aur Isotones ko aapas mein badal dena:**\n   - *Sahi:* Iso**p**es (same **p**rotons Z); Iso**b**ars (same mass number **A**); Iso**n**es (same **n**eutrons N = A − Z)!"
