            "body": "Science museum ki diwaar par bade aksharon mein **E = m c²** likha tha. Uske neeche ek weighing scale ka model dikhaya gaya tha: left pan par **2 protons + 2 neutrons** alag-alag rakhe the, aur right pan par unhi chaaron se bana ek **Helium (⁴₂He) nucleus**! **Sajid** hairaan reh gaya — Helium nucleus un chaaron nucleons ke total wazan se **thoda halka** tha!\n\nGuide ne bataya: \"Jab protons aur neutrons judkar nucleus banate hain, to unka thoda sa mass (**Mass Defect, Δm**) gayab hokar **E = Δm c²** ke roop mein zabardast **Binding Energy** bankar bahar nikal jaata hai!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Science museum ki diwaar par bade aksharon mein **E = m c²** likha tha. Uske neeche ek weighing scale ka model dikhaya gaya tha: left pan par **2 protons + 2 neutrons** alag-alag rakhe the, aur right pan par unhi chaaron se bana ek **Helium (⁴₂He) nucleus**! **Sajid** hairaan reh gaya — Helium nucleus un chaaron nucleons ke total wazan se **thoda halka** tha!\n\nGuide ne bataya: \"Jab protons aur neutrons judkar nucleus banate hain, to unka thoda sa mass (**Mass Defect, Δm**) gayab hokar **E = Δm c²** ke roop mein zabardast **Binding Energy** bankar bahar nikal jaata hai!\""
