            "headingHinglish": "92 Protons Ek Nanhe Nucleus mein Phate Kyun Nahi?",
            "body": "Chemistry chart par Uranium (**²³⁸₉₂U**) dekh kar **Salim** chaunk gaya: \"Iske sirf 7 fm bade nucleus mein **92 positive protons** ek-doosre se chipak kar baithe hain! Coulomb's law ke hisaab se itni kam doori par unke beech hazaaron Newton ka repulsion hona chahiye tha — phir nucleus turant phat kyun nahi jaata?\"\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Kyunki 1–2 fm ki behad chhoti doori par ek aisa zabardast force aata hai jo electrostatic repulsion se bhi **100 guna zyada takatwar** hota hai — use **Strong Nuclear Force** kehte hain! Aur jab koi bhaari nucleus thoda unstable ho jaata hai, to woh α, β ya γ radiation chhod kar **Radioactive Decay** karta hai!\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Radioactivity](../../../class10/physics/radioactivity/radioactivity.md) mein α, β aur γ rays ka basic parichay padha tha. *(Safety Note: Radioactive materials sirf controlled facilities mein trained scientists dwara handle kiye jaate hain — yahan hum poora physics theory aur equations se samjhenge!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chemistry chart par Uranium (**²³⁸₉₂U**) dekh kar **Salim** chaunk gaya: \"Iske sirf 7 fm bade nucleus mein **92 positive protons** ek-doosre se chipak kar baithe hain! Coulomb's law ke hisaab se itni kam doori par unke beech hazaaron Newton ka repulsion hona chahiye tha — phir nucleus turant phat kyun nahi jaata?\"\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Kyunki 1–2 fm ki behad chhoti doori par ek aisa zabardast force aata hai jo electrostatic repulsion se bhi **100 guna zyada takatwar** hota hai — use **Strong Nuclear Force** kehte hain! Aur jab koi bhaari nucleus thoda unstable ho jaata hai, to woh α, β ya γ radiation chhod kar **Radioactive Decay** karta hai!\"\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Radioactivity](../../../class10/physics/radioactivity/radioactivity.md) mein α, β aur γ rays ka basic parichay padha tha. *(Safety Note: Radioactive materials sirf controlled facilities mein trained scientists dwara handle kiye jaate hain — yahan hum poora physics theory aur equations se samjhenge!)*"
