            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "body": "- **Q-Value of a Nuclear Reaction:** Reaction mein release (ya absorb) hui net energy: **Q = (m_reactants − m_products) × 931.5 MeV**. (Q > 0: Exothermic / energy released; Q < 0: Endothermic / energy absorbed!)\n- **Nuclear Fission:** Ek bhaari nucleus (jaise ²³⁵₉₂U) par slow (thermal) neutron takrane par uska do medium-size nuclei mein tootna + 2–3 neutrons + **~200 MeV** energy!\n- **Nuclear Fusion:** Do ya zyada bahut halke nuclei (jaise Hydrogen isotopes) ka behad high temperature (~10⁷ K) par judkar ek bhaari nucleus (jaise Helium) banana aur zabardast energy chhodna!\n- **Moderator:** Nuclear reactor mein fast neutrons ko **dheema (thermal neutrons)** karne wala material (e.g., Heavy water D₂O, Graphite, Ordinary water).\n- **Control Rods:** Reactor mein extra neutrons ko **absorb** karke chain reaction ko control (ya shut down) karne wali rods (e.g., **Cadmium, Boron**).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Q-Value of a Nuclear Reaction:** Reaction mein release (ya absorb) hui net energy: **Q = (m_reactants − m_products) × 931.5 MeV**. (Q > 0: Exothermic / energy released; Q < 0: Endothermic / energy absorbed!)\n- **Nuclear Fission:** Ek bhaari nucleus (jaise ²³⁵₉₂U) par slow (thermal) neutron takrane par uska do medium-size nuclei mein tootna + 2–3 neutrons + **~200 MeV** energy!\n- **Nuclear Fusion:** Do ya zyada bahut halke nuclei (jaise Hydrogen isotopes) ka behad high temperature (~10⁷ K) par judkar ek bhaari nucleus (jaise Helium) banana aur zabardast energy chhodna!\n- **Moderator:** Nuclear reactor mein fast neutrons ko **dheema (thermal neutrons)** karne wala material (e.g., Heavy water D₂O, Graphite, Ordinary water).\n- **Control Rods:** Reactor mein extra neutrons ko **absorb** karke chain reaction ko control (ya shut down) karne wali rods (e.g., **Cadmium, Boron**)."
