            "bodyHinglish": "Metro station par **Sejal** ne dekha ki entry turnstile gate ek taraf dhakka dene par aasaani se khul jaata hai, par ulte direction se aane par bilkul **lock** ho jaata hai! Electronics ki duniya mein bhi ek aisa hi \"one-way current gate\" hota hai — jise **p-n Junction Diode** kehte hain!\n\nJab ek hi Silicon crystal ke ek hisse ko **p-type** aur doosre hisse ko **n-type** dope kiya jaata hai, to unki boundary (junction) par ek ajeeb sa jaadu hota hai! Chalo dekhte hain kaise!"
