            "bodyHinglish": "**Shefali** ne apne room mein chaaron taraf dekha: uska mobile charger deewar ki 220 V **AC** ko 5 V **DC** mein badal raha tha, study table par chamakdaar **LED** lamp jal raha tha, TV ka remote receiver light detect kar raha tha (**Photodiode**), aur ghar ki chhat par **Solar Panels** dhoop se bijli bana rahe the!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Shefali, yeh chaaron modern gadgets — Rectifier, Zener Regulator, LED, Photodiode aur Solar Cell — sab alag-alag tareeke se istemaal kiye gaye **p-n Junction Diodes** hi hain!\""
