            "bodyHinglish": "Robotics club mein **Shikha** ek 2-switch security lock circuit (low-voltage 5 V battery ke saath, bilkul safe!) bana rahi thi. Uski shart thi: \"Green LED **SIRF tab** jalna chahiye jab **Switch A AUR Switch B DONO ON (1)** hon! Agar koi ek bhi OFF (0) ho, to LED bandh (0) rahe!\"\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Shikha, tune abhi-abhi ek **AND Logic Gate** ka niyam bol diya! Duniya ke sabhi computers, smartphones aur calculators sirf do levels — **0 (LOW / OFF)** aur **1 (HIGH / ON)** — par kaam karte hain, aur unke poore dimaag sirf **5 chhote Logic Gates** se bane hote hain!\""
